{"type":"message","id":"1ceb5fc8","parentId":"d9b64f86","timestamp":"2026-05-04T23:24:02.835Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm a business broker and I need a valuation tool for small service businesses like HVAC or landscaping. Can you base it on Seller's Discretionary Earnings?"}],"timestamp":1777937042833}}
{"type":"message","id":"a5d33926","parentId":"1ceb5fc8","timestamp":"2026-05-04T23:25:10.934Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants a valuation tool for small service businesses (like HVAC or landscaping) based on Seller's Discretionary Earnings (SDE). SDE is a common valuation method for small businesses where you take the business's earnings and add back the owner's salary and benefits, plus any discretionary expenses.\n\nLet me think about what this tool needs:\n1. Input fields for financial data (revenue, expenses, owner's salary, etc.)\n2. Calculation of SDE\n3. Application of a multiple (typically 1-3x for small service businesses)\n4. Output showing the valuation\n\nI should create a web-based tool, probably a simple HTML/JS page that can be run locally. Let me create a clean, professional valuation tool.\n\nLet me start by creating the tool with:\n- Input section for financial data\n- SDE calculation\n- Multiple selection (industry-specific)\n- Valuation output\n- Maybe some context/explanation\n\nI'll create an HTML file with embedded CSS and JavaScript.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"I'll create a professional SDE-based valuation tool for small service businesses. Let me build an HTML/JS tool that calculates valuation based on Seller's Discretionary Earnings."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9e698d5eccc29bb9","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/sde-valuation-tool.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>SDE Valuation Tool - Small Service Businesses</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        \n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, sans-serif;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            padding: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .container {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background: white;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        \n        .header {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c3e50, #3498db);\n            color: white;\n            padding: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        \n        .header h1 {\n            font-size: 28px;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        \n        .header p {\n            opacity: 0.9;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        \n        .content {\n            padding: 30px;\n        }\n        \n        .section {\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        \n        .section-title {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            color: #2c3e50;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;\n        }\n        \n        .form-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .form-group {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n        \n        label {\n            font-weight: 600;\n            margin-bottom: 8px;\n            color: #34495e;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n        \n        input, select {\n            padding: 12px;\n            border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            transition: border-color 0.3s;\n        }\n        \n        input:focus, select:focus {\n            outline: none;\n            border-color: #3498db;\n        }\n        \n        .addback-section {\n            background: #f8f9fa;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .addback-item {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 10px 0;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n        }\n        \n        .addback-item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n        }\n        \n        .addback-label {\n            flex: 1;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n        \n        .addback-input {\n            width: 150px;\n            padding: 8px;\n            border: 1px solid #ddd;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            text-align: right;\n        }\n        \n        .btn {\n            background: #3498db;\n            color: white;\n            padding: 14px 30px;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: background 0.3s;\n            width: 100%;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .btn:hover {\n            background: #2980b9;\n        }\n        \n        .results {\n            display: none;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            padding: 30px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa, #e9ecef);\n            border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n        \n        .results.show {\n            display: block;\n        }\n        \n        .valuation-summary {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        \n        .valuation-amount {\n            font-size: 48px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #27ae60;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        \n        .valuation-label {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: #7f8c8d;\n        }\n        \n        .breakdown {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n        }\n        \n        .breakdown-item {\n            background: white;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: 8px;\n            text-align: center;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n        }\n        \n        .breakdown-value {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #2c3e50;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        \n        .breakdown-label {\n            color: #7f8c8d;\n            font-size: 14px;\n        }\n        \n        .multiple-info {\n            background: #fff3cd;\n            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;\n            padding: 15px;\n            margin-top: 20px;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        \n        .multiple-info strong {\n            color: #856404;\n        }\n        \n        .tooltip {\n            display: inline-block;\n            position: relative;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n            color: #3498db;\n            cursor: help;\n        }\n        \n        .tooltip .tooltiptext {\n            visibility: hidden;\n            width: 300px;\n            background-color: #2c3e50;\n            color: white;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 10px;\n            border-radius: 6px;\n            position: absolute;\n            z-index: 1;\n            bottom: 125%;\n            left: 50%;\n            margin-left: -150px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            opacity: 0;\n            transition: opacity 0.3s;\n        }\n        \n        .tooltip:hover .tooltiptext {\n            visibility: visible;\n            opacity: 1;\n        }\n        \n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .form-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n            \n            .valuation-amount {\n                font-size: 36px;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h1>\ud83c\udfe2 SDE Valuation Tool</h1>\n            <p>For Small Service Businesses (HVAC, Landscaping, Cleaning, etc.)</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"section\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Business Information</h2>\n                <div class=\"form-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"businessName\">Business Name</label>\n                        <input type=\"text\" id=\"businessName\" placeholder=\"Enter business name\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"businessType\">Service Type</label>\n                        <select id=\"businessType\">\n                            <option value=\"hvac\">HVAC</option>\n                            <option value=\"landscaping\">Landscaping</option>\n                            <option value=\"cleaning\">Cleaning Services</option>\n                            <option value=\"plumbing\">Plumbing</option>\n                            <option value=\"electrical\">Electrical</option>\n                            <option value=\"pest-control\">Pest Control</option>\n                            <option value=\"pool-service\">Pool Service</option>\n                            <option value=\"other\">Other Service Business</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"annualRevenue\">Annual Revenue ($)</label>\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"annualRevenue\" placeholder=\"e.g., 500000\" step=\"10000\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"section\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Profit & Loss (Annual)</h2>\n                <div class=\"form-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"netProfit\">Net Profit / Taxable Income ($)\n                            <span class=\"tooltip\">\u2139\ufe0f\n                                <span class=\"tooltiptext\">Net profit from tax returns before owner's compensation is added back</span>\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"netProfit\" placeholder=\"e.g., 80000\" step=\"5000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"ownerSalary\">Owner's Salary/Wages ($)</label>\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"ownerSalary\" placeholder=\"e.g., 100000\" step=\"5000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"ownerBenefits\">Owner Benefits & Perks ($)\n                            <span class=\"tooltip\">\u2139\ufe0f\n                                <span class=\"tooltiptext\">Health insurance, vehicle allowance, retirement contributions, etc.</span>\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"ownerBenefits\" placeholder=\"e.g., 15000\" step=\"1000\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"section\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">SDE Addbacks</h2>\n                <div class=\"addback-section\">\n                    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; color: #666;\">Add back discretionary or one-time expenses to calculate true earnings potential:</p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"addback-item\">\n                        <span class=\"addback-label\">Depreciation & Amortization</span>\n                        <input type=\"number\" class=\"addback-input\" id=\"depreciation\" value=\"0\" step=\"1000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"addback-item\">\n                        <span class=\"addback-label\">Interest Expense</span>\n                        <input type=\"number\" class=\"addback-input\" id=\"interest\" value=\"0\" step=\"500\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"addback-item\">\n                        <span class=\"addback-label\">One-time/Non-recurring Expenses</span>\n                        <input type=\"number\" class=\"addback-input\" id=\"oneTime\" value=\"0\" step=\"1000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"addback-item\">\n                        <span class=\"addback-label\">Owner's Personal Expenses run through business</span>\n                        <input type=\"number\" class=\"addback-input\" id=\"personalExp\" value=\"0\" step=\"1000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"addback-item\">\n                        <span class=\"addback-label\">Family Member Wages (if not essential)</span>\n                        <input type=\"number\" class=\"addback-input\" id=\"familyWages\" value=\"0\" step=\"1000\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"addback-item\">\n                        <span class=\"addback-label\">Other Discretionary Expenses</span>\n                        <input type=\"number\" class=\"addback-input\" id=\"otherAddbacks\" value=\"0\" step=\"1000\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"section\">\n                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Valuation Multiple</h2>\n                <div class=\"form-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"multiple\">SDE Multiple\n                            <span class=\"tooltip\">\u2139\ufe0f\n                                <span class=\"tooltiptext\">Typical ranges: HVAC (2.0-3.5x), Landscaping (1.5-3.0x), Cleaning (1.0-2.5x). Higher multiples for businesses with strong recurring revenue, growth trends, and transferable systems.</span>\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <input type=\"number\" id=\"multiple\" value=\"2.5\" step=\"0.1\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"form-group\">\n                        <label for=\"multipleReason\">Multiple Justification (Optional)</label>\n                        <select id=\"multipleReason\">\n                            <option value=\"standard\">Standard - Typical for industry</option>\n                            <option value=\"strong\">Strong - Recurring revenue, growth, systems</option>\n                            <option value=\"premium\">Premium - Dominant market position, turnkey</option>\n                            <option value=\"below\">Below Average - Declining, high owner dependency</option>\n                        </select>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"multiple-info\">\n                    <strong>\ud83d\udca1 Multiple Guidelines:</strong><br>\n                    \u2022 <strong>1.0-1.5x:</strong> Weak businesses, heavy owner dependency, declining<br>\n                    \u2022 <strong>1.5-2.5x:</strong> Average service businesses with some recurring revenue<br>\n                    \u2022 <strong>2.5-3.5x:</strong> Strong businesses with contracts, systems, growth<br>\n                    \u2022 <strong>3.5x+:</strong> Premium businesses, highly transferable, excellent records\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <button class=\"btn\" onclick=\"calculateValuation()\">\ud83d\udcca Calculate Valuation</button>\n            \n            <div class=\"results\" id=\"results\">\n                <div class=\"valuation-summary\">\n                    <div class=\"valuation-label\">Estimated Business Valuation</div>\n                    <div class=\"valuation-amount\" id=\"valuationAmount\">$0</div>\n                    <div class=\"valuation-label\" id=\"valuationRange\"></div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"breakdown\">\n                    <div class=\"breakdown-item\">\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-label\">Seller's Discretionary Earnings</div>\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-value\" id=\"sdeValue\">$0</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"breakdown-item\">\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-label\">Applied Multiple</div>\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-value\" id=\"multipleValue\">0x</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"breakdown-item\">\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-label\">Annual Revenue</div>\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-value\" id=\"revenueValue\">$0</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"breakdown-item\">\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-label\">SDE Margin</div>\n                        <div class=\"breakdown-value\" id=\"sdeMargin\">0%</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"multiple-info\" style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n                    <strong>\ud83d\udccb SDE Calculation Breakdown:</strong>\n                    <div id=\"sdeBreakdown\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; line-height: 2;\"></div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"multiple-info\" style=\"background: #d4edda; border-color: #28a745;\">\n                    <strong>\u2705 Next Steps:</strong><br>\n                    \u2022 Review 3 years of tax returns to verify trends<br>\n                    \u2022 Analyze customer concentration and contracts<br>\n                    \u2022 Evaluate owner dependency and systems<br>\n                    \u2022 Consider getting a professional business appraisal<br>\n                    \u2022 This is an estimate - actual sale price depends on market conditions, buyer demand, and negotiations\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <script>\n        function formatCurrency(num) {\n            return '$' + num.toLocaleString('en-US', {minimumFractionDigits: 0, maximumFractionDigits: 0});\n        }\n        \n        function calculateValuation() {\n            // Get input values\n            const netProfit = parseFloat(document.getElementById('netProfit').value) || 0;\n            const ownerSalary = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ownerSalary').value) || 0;\n            const ownerBenefits = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ownerBenefits').value) || 0;\n            const depreciation = parseFloat(document.getElementById('depreciation').value) || 0;\n            const interest = parseFloat(document.getElementById('interest').value) || 0;\n            const oneTime = parseFloat(document.getElementById('oneTime').value) || 0;\n            const personalExp = parseFloat(document.getElementById('personalExp').value) || 0;\n            const familyWages = parseFloat(document.getElementById('familyWages').value) || 0;\n            const otherAddbacks = parseFloat(document.getElementById('otherAddbacks').value) || 0;\n            const multiple = parseFloat(document.getElementById('multiple').value) || 2.5;\n            const revenue = parseFloat(document.getElementById('annualRevenue').value) || 0;\n            \n            // Calculate SDE\n            const sde = netProfit + ownerSalary + ownerBenefits + depreciation + interest + oneTime + personalExp + familyWages + otherAddbacks;\n            \n            // Calculate valuation\n            const valuation = sde * multiple;\n            \n            // Calculate range (\u00b115%)\n            const lowRange = valuation * 0.85;\n            const highRange = valuation * 1.15;\n            \n            // Calculate SDE margin\n            const sdeMargin = revenue > 0 ? ((sde / revenue) * 100).toFixed(1) : 0;\n            \n            // Update display\n            document.getElementById('valuationAmount').textContent = formatCurrency(valuation);\n            document.getElementById('valuationRange').textContent = `Estimated Range: ${formatCurrency(lowRange)} - ${formatCurrency(highRange)}`;\n            document.getElementById('sdeValue').textContent = formatCurrency(sde);\n            document.getElementById('multipleValue').textContent = multiple.toFixed(1) + 'x';\n            document.getElementById('revenueValue').textContent = formatCurrency(revenue);\n            document.getElementById('sdeMargin').textContent = sdeMargin + '%';\n            \n            // SDE Breakdown\n            let breakdown = `\n                Net Profit: ${formatCurrency(netProfit)}<br>\n                + Owner's Salary: ${formatCurrency(ownerSalary)}<br>\n                + Owner's Benefits: ${formatCurrency(ownerBenefits)}<br>\n                + Depreciation/Amortization: ${formatCurrency(depreciation)}<br>\n                + Interest Expense: ${formatCurrency(interest)}<br>\n                + One-time Expenses: ${formatCurrency(oneTime)}<br>\n                + Personal Expenses: ${formatCurrency(personalExp)}<br>\n                + Family Wages: ${formatCurrency(familyWages)}<br>\n                + Other Addbacks: ${formatCurrency(otherAddbacks)}<br>\n                <hr style=\"margin: 10px 0;\"><strong>\n                = SDE: ${formatCurrency(sde)}</strong>\n            `;\n            document.getElementById('sdeBreakdown').innerHTML = breakdown;\n            \n            // Show results\n            document.getElementById('results').classList.add('show');\n            \n            // Scroll to results\n            document.getElementById('results').scrollIntoView({behavior: 'smooth'});\n        }\n        \n        // Auto-adjust multiple based on business type\n        document.getElementById('businessType').addEventListener('change', function() {\n            const multiples = {\n                'hvac': 2.7,\n                'landscaping': 2.2,\n                'cleaning': 1.8,\n                'plumbing': 2.5,\n                'electrical': 2.6,\n                'pest-control': 2.3,\n                'pool-service': 2.0,\n                'other': 2.5\n            };\n            document.getElementById('multiple').value = multiples[this.value] || 2.5;\n        });\n        \n        // Auto-adjust multiple based on justification\n        document.getElementById('multipleReason').addEventListener('change', function() {\n            const baseMultiple = parseFloat(document.getElementById('multiple').value) || 2.5;\n            const adjustments = {\n                'standard': 0,\n                'strong': 0.5,\n                'premium': 1.0,\n                'below': -0.7\n            };\n            const adjustment = adjustments[this.value] || 0;\n            // Only adjust if user hasn't manually changed it significantly\n            const businessType = document.getElementById('businessType').value;\n            const multiples = {\n                'hvac': 2.7,\n                'landscaping': 2.2,\n                'cleaning': 1.8,\n                'plumbing': 2.5,\n                'electrical': 2.6,\n                'pest-control': 2.3,\n                'pool-service': 2.0,\n                'other': 2.5\n            };\n            const baseForType = multiples[businessType] || 2.5;\n            document.getElementById('multiple').value = (baseForType + adjustment).toFixed(1);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","model":"tencent/hy3-preview:free","usage":{"input":1419,"output":5084,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":6503,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777937042853,"responseId":"gen-1777937041-Hsv0kwaD0cfIGdGLkHmU"}}
